WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
Two brands tied on mentions.

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:05.140
But four assistants chose
four different brands first.

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:09.080
In RecoScope’s November 17
wireless earbuds benchmark,

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:13.260
Sony and Beats each appeared in
9 of 12 usable answers.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:14.960
In the comparative prompt,

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:17.300
ChatGPT ranked Sony first.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:19.420
Claude ranked Jabra first.

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:21.540
Gemini ranked Apple first.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.820
And Perplexity ranked Beats first.

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.260
Same commuter and gym routine.

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:27.780
Three prompt types:

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:31.380
discovery, under $150, and ranking.

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:34.240
Soundcore appeared in
every budget answer.

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:38.420
Those mentions don’t verify
an under-$150 checkout price.

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:42.040
Brand visibility and comparative
rank tell different stories.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:46.100
These findings describe captured
answers, not product quality.

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:49.180
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
